                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a43c851-eb7b-484f-8543-0586bd9abd52",
                        "source_entry_id": "6c694041-6c92-3749-824e-fc0ae0df13fb",
                        "source_sense_id": "110373ef-3909-3d69-873b-440ce7b684b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "confidant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confidant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fb16ecf-5047-3d23-b6eb-6807b3e18a9c",
                                        "entry_id": "8aa38900-1219-3b95-8905-542b867d4cd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person in whom one can confide or share one's secrets: a friend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "954bd9cd-f292-45ca-8643-b5c67c3dd1cb",
                                                "sense_id": "5fb16ecf-5047-3d23-b6eb-6807b3e18a9c",
                                                "text": "Heaven made you love me for no other end, / But to become my confidant and friend: / As such, I keep no secret from your sight, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa57e3cf-afaf-42ea-acf8-ff3c5604c43c",
                                                "sense_id": "5fb16ecf-5047-3d23-b6eb-6807b3e18a9c",
                                                "text": "One in thought and purpose, linked by the necessity of combating one hostile fate, a power antagonistic ever, - a power we lived to evade, - we had no confidants save ourselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62369c4f-1a0b-4d48-bb13-ecce6164159f",
                                                "sense_id": "5fb16ecf-5047-3d23-b6eb-6807b3e18a9c",
                                                "text": "Bankman-Fried’s confidants were along for the ride. At his side was Caroline Ellison, Alameda’s CEO and his on-again, off-again lover."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6be9fdd9-a0a0-4f86-b01a-ecd269220cfb",
                        "source_entry_id": "6c694041-6c92-3749-824e-fc0ae0df13fb",
                        "source_sense_id": "110373ef-3909-3d69-873b-440ce7b684b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "confident",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confident",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a41f5237-2bb8-3b66-8da4-d639555c36fc",
                                        "entry_id": "3470ccf9-ac1c-3edf-9f29-1334ce223aaa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very sure of something; positive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b2af300-94f5-4fb9-bfc0-524b3086bbfd",
                                                "sense_id": "a41f5237-2bb8-3b66-8da4-d639555c36fc",
                                                "text": "I'm pretty confident that she's not lying, she's acting normally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c57ee2b-4d81-4a0a-a507-c8e60b025cf6",
                                                "sense_id": "a41f5237-2bb8-3b66-8da4-d639555c36fc",
                                                "text": "He was confident of success."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58434c4d-b0b4-36a4-bb16-fe939db04b90",
                                        "entry_id": "3470ccf9-ac1c-3edf-9f29-1334ce223aaa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Self-assured, self-reliant, sure of oneself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31384d84-8eb3-3e19-952e-f76f6b7c4015",
                                        "entry_id": "3470ccf9-ac1c-3edf-9f29-1334ce223aaa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Forward, impudent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8612b32d-22bc-404a-b41c-48c2ca3891b0",
                                                "sense_id": "31384d84-8eb3-3e19-952e-f76f6b7c4015",
                                                "text": "I was rated as the most confident ruffian, for daring to approach her room at that hour of night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "confident",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6234cdc0-6223-3dc4-880c-d7577a9e6bec",
                                        "entry_id": "54f3d855-eda9-3cf0-8a0b-9454285e6bc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obsolete form of confidant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "347bff06-9907-4f5e-9fe5-8a2bd6909730",
                                                "sense_id": "6234cdc0-6223-3dc4-880c-d7577a9e6bec",
                                                "text": "He managed this consultation with exceeding secrecy, admitting only four or five of his confidents, on whom he most relied"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c35fd87-a7ed-4e31-8589-fab7f56b1a3c",
                                                "sense_id": "6234cdc0-6223-3dc4-880c-d7577a9e6bec",
                                                "text": "a certain Lawyer , a great Confident of the Rebels"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "463560c6-631f-4cab-992e-c47a59cf5b60",
                        "source_entry_id": "6c694041-6c92-3749-824e-fc0ae0df13fb",
                        "source_sense_id": "110373ef-3909-3d69-873b-440ce7b684b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "repository",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "repository",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90f262b4-1119-3e1e-a759-2b325e1b2f11",
                                        "entry_id": "9b3829c0-a44f-39df-8970-81d3afc8ccd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location for storage, often for safety or preservation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5739bf6-1ce8-4141-ab54-92c95f8a7ddb",
                                                "sense_id": "90f262b4-1119-3e1e-a759-2b325e1b2f11",
                                                "text": "Harvard has declined to become the repository of George Segal's controversial sculpture, \"Gay Liberation.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b906dbd-acb1-3915-8d26-3adbabf42754",
                                        "entry_id": "9b3829c0-a44f-39df-8970-81d3afc8ccd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location for storage, often for safety or preservation.",
                                            "A storage location for files, such as downloadable software packages, or files in a source control system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a3303d9-439a-40d0-939d-acd2e53c6fa3",
                                                "sense_id": "4b906dbd-acb1-3915-8d26-3adbabf42754",
                                                "text": "OpenSNP, a fourteen-year-old open source repository for genetic records, will shut down and delete all its data at the end of April."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fe4b12e-999c-48a0-8397-8a12096f2f9a",
                                                "sense_id": "4b906dbd-acb1-3915-8d26-3adbabf42754",
                                                "text": "Over the years, openSNP became one of the largest repositories of its kind, used in research, education, and even community-led investigations like debunking flawed CFS genetic studies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6de80cbb-eaa8-3dbd-8cb7-d0137e70f6be",
                                        "entry_id": "9b3829c0-a44f-39df-8970-81d3afc8ccd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location for storage, often for safety or preservation.",
                                            "A burial vault."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
